# T6.5: what a kit stores. On the flanger page: E (TEST in GT1T: k 48) +10, F (TST2: k 87) +7, A (DPTH,
# stock k 25) +3; then pattern A01 copied (FUNC+REC) and pasted into A02 (PTN, TRIG 2, FUNC+STOP), and
# the flanger page of A02 shown. Run with t65_live.py --state --fx-roundtrip: the live FX words, the
# frame to the DSP and every kit's stored FX record in the working image are compared with FTN1's.
